This license covers the code of this repository: the pipeline in scripts/, the tests in tests/, and the build
machinery. It does not and cannot cover two other things the repository holds.

The manuscript sources under sections/ and the figures the pipeline draws are the authors' work and are not part of
the Software; until the article is published they carry no separate licence, and the licence of the published version
is the one the journal grants.

The data under data/ are third-party and keep the terms of their sources. The bioactivity table derives from the
release of Karimova & Senanayake (github.com/karimova/pIC50_paper), itself assembled from ChEMBL and BindingDB; the
screening library is a PubChem extract; the MoleculeACE benchmarks are those of van Tilborg et al.; and the receptor
is PDB entry 6AOG. Each of those is redistributed here so that the pipeline runs as published, under its own licence
and not under this one.
